to all that you knew. You can see huge towers around you, suspended by something that you do not know, but that at all times makes you think they change places, turning in 
an incredible psychedelic effect for your eyes. A soft music reaches your ears accompanied by strange and at the same time comforting images that you think you have never 
seen in your life, but somehow you know that is what your eyes need to see. A delicious breeze hits his face, shaking his hair happily as if to say "Hello, welcome." Your 
body completely tunes into this place, making you think that this could last forever and you would never need to go back to your bloody routine.
