a Roman legionary. However, his cruelty and military indiscipline caused him to be expelled from the legion. He thus became a deserter, harassed throughout the Roman world. 
However, he saw in the Colosseum the opportunity to have the safe-conduct in all the Roman world, besides being paid and treated well doing what he liked to do. Since his 
entry into the coliseum barracks, his life has changed for the better. He acquired fame, money, reputation. And in exchange for this, he lost only one eye to one of his fights. 
Aiellus is easily recognized for wearing a black cloth eye patch made from a silk bandanna throwed by some nobility woman.
