his enemy, to immolate him gradually, exhilarating from every gush of blood. He can fight in this sadistic way thanks to his enormous and well-known agility, capable of providing 
him with a method of almost acrobatic fighting. Cirix has another particularity. He fights without heavy armor, exposing his body, replete with tribal tattoos.
